///1XREF
Help by Willem Aandewiel
XREF - Find symbol references in assembly source

///2SYNTAX
  E>A:XREF DEMO

XREF needs DEMO.PRN and DEMO.SYM from the same MAC or RMAC assembly.
It creates DEMO.XRF.

///2WORKFLOW
  E>A:MAC DEMO
  E>A:XREF DEMO
  E>TYPE DEMO.XRF

Use current PRN and SYM files with the same base name.

///2OUTPUT
The cross-reference helps locate uses of a symbol.
XREF DEMO $P sends output to the list device.
This requires a working printer device configuration.
XREF is not an assembler and does not create an executable COM file.
